<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<gpx version="1.1" creator="book_route.py" xmlns="http://www.topografix.com/GPX/1/1">
<metadata><name>Alpine Ski Trail</name><desc>or-vielbig-2e:126-1: route read from the book's text and sketch map. One trkseg per waypoint pair, in order; segment sources are in the trk desc. Geometry from OSM (ODbL, (c) OpenStreetMap contributors) and USFS EDW (public domain) where marked; 'straight' segments are off-trail connectors, not traced.</desc></metadata>
<wpt lat="45.331129" lon="-121.711243"><ele>1813.1</ele><name>Timberline Lodge</name><desc>source: DB trailhead pin th:timberline-lodge (OSM way 149173768); confidence: high; pdf_page: 128; book_elev_ft: 5950; quote: This 3-mile one-way descent from Timberline to the Summit Ski Area is very fast, direct, and unmarked.</desc></wpt>
<wpt lat="45.325174" lon="-121.711109"><ele>1722.8</ele><name>Top of the West Leg Road</name><desc>source: OSM node shared by Timberline Highway (way 1159783308) and Timberline West Leg Road (way 50427210); confidence: high; pdf_page: 129; quote: If you are skiing down from Timberline, ski to this obvious switchback on the West Leg</desc></wpt>
<wpt lat="45.326430" lon="-121.720310"><ele>1689.5</ele><name>West Leg switchback (top of Alpine Trail #660)</name><desc>source: OSM node shared by Timberline West Leg Road (way 50427210) at its sharp westward switchback and the upper end of path 'Alpine Trail #660' (way 146985849); ~0.6 mi below the lodge; confidence: high; pdf_page: 129; quote: The lower terminus of the chairlift is located just 100 yards west of a sharp switchback about 0.5 mile below Timberline Lodge ... down and west through open areas into a wide, open clearing and the lower end of the chairlift. ... a large orange-painted sign marking the beginning of the Alpine Ski Trail.</desc></wpt>
<wpt lat="45.302544" lon="-121.745583"><ele>1211.1</ele><name>Summit Sno-Park</name><desc>source: DB trailhead pin th:summit-sno-park (the tour's end trailhead); lower end of Alpine Trail #660 is 50 m away; confidence: high; pdf_page: 128; book_elev_ft: 3880; quote: descent from Timberline to the Summit Ski Area</desc></wpt>
<trk><name>Alpine Ski Trail</name><desc>1. Timberline Lodge -&gt; Top of the West Leg Road: osm (medium), 0.54 mi | 2. Top of the West Leg Road -&gt; West Leg switchback (top of Alpine Trail #660): line (high), 0.61 mi | 3. West Leg switchback (top of Alpine Trail #660) -&gt; Summit Sno-Park: osm (high), 2.37 mi</desc>
